# Top 3 Uptime's by Host

Uptime is the total uptime of a host over the entire lifespan.

```
+-----+---------+-----------------------------+
| Pos |    Host |                      Uptime |
+-----+---------+-----------------------------+
|  1. |  vulcan |   4 years, 4 months, 7 days |
|  2. |  uranus | 3 years, 11 months, 21 days |
|  3. |     sun |  3 years, 9 months, 26 days |
+-----+---------+-----------------------------+
```
